!scripts/contract-check.mjs
ARCHITECTURE.md
# The vitest suite left the repository on 2026-11-14 (operator decision):
# tests/ and vitest.config.ts are gone; the suite remains recoverable from git
# history (tag v0.9.8 and earlier). What replaced it is scripts/contract-check.mjs
# — plain node:test over the COMPILED dist/, pinning the host event shape and
# the redaction line. Unlike the rest of scripts/ (local operator tooling),
# contract-check.mjs IS tracked: package.json's `test:contract` runs it inside
# `verify`, `prepack` gates verify, and src/ comments cite it as the contract
# pin — a fresh clone without it breaks verify and pack (2026-11-20 review).
# The tarball stays clean: pack.sh rejects package/scripts/ outright.
# verify = typecheck + build + test:contract.

release/

# bench replay outputs (generated reports)
bench-results/

# === Pack scripts: machine-local operator tooling (encoding/format quirks
# === differ per machine; installs use the release URL instead) ===
pack.ps1
pack.sh
